rom the PRIORITY frame decoder\nb33c3d88c [refactor] report errors directly from the HEADERS frame decoder\n95e9a6e10 [refactor] report errors directly from the DATA frame decoder\n147fde2ef send appropriate errors when receiving an invalid WINDOW_UPDATE frame\n6152efc61 report appropriate error for invalid PING frame\n68e841058 [http2] refine the way errors are reported back\nc82355a11 draft-16 (+dependency) now works w. firefox 38.0a1 (still wip)\nbc0ec4d18 implement PRIORITY frame decoder\n552464e73 [http2] default weight is 16\ne62d2350b send the errors defined in HTTP/2 spec when receiving an invalid WINDOW_UPDATE frame\n1faad495b Merge branch 'master' into kazuho/http2/dependency\n9cb45394b apply misc/clang-format-all.sh\n5ae7b50fb implement PRIORITY frame decoder\n1c4e032ab [http2][refactor] split the call paths bet. connection-level / stream-level errors (as well as send debugging information for the former)\nb0b4b51b6 rename h2o_buf_t to h2o_iovec_t, so that there would be no confusion with h2o_buffer_t or h2o_vector_t\n\n---\n50611d311 mv src lib (prepare to start adding the daemon impl.)",
